        " «عَلَيْهِ دَمٌ يُهَرِيقُهُ وَ إِنْ جَامَعَ فَعَلَيْهِ جَزُورٌ أَوْ بَقَرَةٌ»."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.bab-ul-qaim-publications": [
          "Hadith.2743 - Imran al-Halabi asked Abu Abdullah (as) about a man who performed tawaf of the Kaaba and the sa'i between Safa and Marwa while performing tamattu‘, then hastened and kissed his wife before trimming his hair.\nImam (as) said: \"He must offer a sacrifice of a sheep. If he engaged in intercourse, he must offer a camel or a cow.\""
        ]
      }
